msgid "**Gaps:** All seven exact selected families have separately executed seven-stage lifecycle/deletion records at their own execution revisions; no simultaneous same-revision matrix run is claimed. Preparation timestamps and historical revision context do not establish exact execution times or observed activated-host revisions. Historical failed images, the mutated old Windows diagnostic and original warning-only/oracle failures retain their failed scope. This does not establish every enabled terminal, executor or workspace capability, revocation, growth, native isolation, durability or relocation. Manual rootless-namespace retirement does not establish automatic recovery for arbitrary holders or independent physical cleanup."
