#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:2949
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "- **machine, recorded**: [completed native launch survives actor death before durable outcome recording](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/actor-recovery.py) — Generated generation/replay histories through real Executor, systemd, Firecracker and ZFS; actor suspended with completed result, byte-identical attempt-only journal through kill, native PID/kernel-start/executable and launch-marker equality, stable bound outcome, subsequent guest data access and deletion. Real placement lock first forces Executor retry with exact durable attempt, absent outcome, stopped unit and absent launch marker; release observes helper exit. Four native histories passed in 671 seconds, exit 0. Single disposable native host; no independently observed actor-deferred transition.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-lilly-native-actor-recovery.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [completed native launch survives abrupt worker BEAM loss and fresh Store reopen](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/actor-recovery.py) — Three generated/fixed abrupt source-built release-eval BEAM exit histories after completed result/before record, with one to three independent worker Store/native-lock reopens, exact Firecracker and launch-marker identity, stable outcome, real guest write/read and deletion. Corrected ADR0140-integrated native check at a5b6c891 passed1040seconds, worker histories506.95seconds; isolated workers start the real execution View without runtime/intent authority rows. Production systemd daemon and authenticated Marshall exchange remain excluded.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-lilly-native-beam-recovery.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [completed launch survives actor death before outcome recording](repo:lilly/test/vm/antithesis_actor_property_test.exs) — Real actor/Store/Journal with durable controlled executor; one completed launch and exact recovered outcome across two replacement lifetimes.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-lilly-completed-launch-recovery.md)."
