ion.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [cache recovers onto a separate native ZFS dataset](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/brady-network/storage.py) — Historical 8446a41: actual public HTTP/range reuse with origin stopped, process restart, credential/cookie/query bypass and native ZFS quota/headroom/hysteresis. Veth peers stand in for guests; no new native run in027.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-18-brady-egress-cache.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [large completed HTTPS representations survive proxy restart and origin loss](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/brady-network/large-storage.py) — Final uncommitted b96443ff-based source: exact fixed/chunked HTTPS/ZFS reuse through 256 MiB, second peer, stale publisher read retention/write refusal and fresh resumption, offline restart/ranges, sampled RSS/concurrency and native quota. Veth peers, not Firecracker attribution.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [unknown-length histories reserve exact prefixes and recover complete bytes](repo:brady/test/brady/chunked_store_property_test.exs) — Actual Store files/processes with independent reservation prefix sums, commit/abort/pressure and restart; local filesystem, not native isolation.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated sizes across zero through 256 MiB stream and reuse with bounded chunks](repo:brady/test/brady/chunked_store_property_test.exs) — Generated sizes in the complete interval for fixed/unknown length writes, bounded digest fill/read and exact pending release; no native TLS claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [only public full-commit archive identities infer bounded freshness](repo:brady/test/brady/archive_property_test.exs) — Generated full commits, alternate repositories, foreign hosts/ports/paths/credentials, private/no-store and ambiguous Vary refusal; no upstream/public-repository availability claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [freshness never substitutes for boot or mount custody](repo:brady/test/brady/pressure_test.exs) — Generated ages and foreign boot/device/host samples refuse capacity and custody; native mount checking remains separate.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [egress-archive-request-window](repo:scripts/egress_acceptance.py) — Overalls healthy 8d172891 and descendants: separate legacy/tar.gz references, two independent Nix stores/NAR identity and current owner/generation HTTPS hits; NixOS and Ubuntu also reuse a pinned 318,532,502-byte LLVM archive. No shared-service faults or universal attribution/SSH claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [overlapping unknown-length owners preserve exact object quota and headroom boundaries](repo:brady/test/brady/chunked_boundary_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused local property: two actual supervised Task lease owners, independent metadata/payload reservation sums, object/shared-quota/synthetic pool/parent headroom limits, one-byte overflow, foreign append/commit/abort refusal and exact surviving bytes including empty EOF. Synthetic observations do not establish native ZFS custody, physical interception or TLS. Combined component execution passed 80 checks; native archive execution is separately recorded below.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [unknown-length process loss preserves only completed payloads](repo:brady/test/brady/chunked_boundary_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused local property: real supervised Task owner/Store abrupt death at post-begin/prefix/commit boundaries, independent exact recovered bytes and retained neighbor, monitored death, pending lease cleanup, empty temporary directories and stale references. No mid-sync/rename interruption, failed deletion, native ZFS/custody/power-loss or parser-to-cache completion claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [chunked proxy histories reuse only complete public parser results](repo:brady/test/brady/proxy_chunked_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused local property: actual Proxy/Stream/Cache/Store over loopback HTTP, generated chunks/write fragments and complete/trailer/truncated/malformed/private/overflow outcomes. Exact reused bytes and origin counters, zero refusal objects/pending leases. Policy override models admitted loopback origin only; no production destination filtering, TLS, native interception or inferred archive claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [pinned archive combinations preserve refusals and exact variant identity](repo:brady/test/brady/archive_policy_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused local property: independent directive/Vary expectations, fixed privacy and ambiguity refusals, canonical path limits, exact variant identity and freshness expiry. Policy predicates only; no verified TLS or actual inferred-public proxy reuse claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [repeated pressure transitions preserve readers and fence pending writes](repo:brady/test/brady/pressure_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused local property: repeated synthetic same-binding stale/fresh observations, exact completed/pending costs, refused-write cleanup, pinned readers, resumed exact bytes and missing/changed custody shutdown. Immediate Recovery survival only; eventual recovery and native custody remain unproven.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [brady-native-archive-histories](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/brady-network/large-storage.py) — Recorded native execution (300.02 seconds): fifteen reproducible fixed/generated full-commit archive histories through packaged TLS/proxy/ZFS with two veth clients, independent payload digests and origin counts. Complete anonymous reuse and private/trailer/truncated refusal, including small truncated witnesses. No Firecracker attribution or fleet acceptance claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [unconfirmed removal retains exact charged bytes until confirmed cleanup](repo:brady/test/brady/removal_history_test.exs) — Recorded local injected IO and directory-permission refusal histories: exact reservation retention through repeated aborts, pinned neighbor bytes, one-time reclamation after repaired permissions and resumed publication. Focused execution passed under UID 1000; no native ZFS or mid-publication power-loss claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-large-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [wide pending prefixes distinguish exact quota and one-byte overflow](repo:brady/test/brady/budget_test.exs) — Generated exact-fit/one-byte-overflow pending accounting around 2^31 and 2^32; focused execution passed, not native delivery.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [multi-GiB declared leases retain exact reservations and object refusals](repo:brady/test/brady/chunked_store_property_test.exs) — Actual real-file Store declared admission with two overlapping multi-GiB leases, object/quota refusal and incomplete commit/abort accounting. Sparse admission does not establish full delivery.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [    4 * 1024**3 + 1,](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/brady-network/large-storage.py) — Recorded native fixed/chunked delivery through 4 GiB + 1 byte, offline restart/ranges across signed/unsigned 32-bit boundaries, four 4 GiB readers plus a slow reader, unchanged RSS bounds, sensitive/incomplete refusal and real quota/headroom. Packaged TLS/ZFS veth scope; no Firecracker attribution.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [    def large4gib(self) -> None:](repo:scripts/egress_acceptance.py) — Baseline Overalls ef8e997f, complete-4gib stage: two exact 7,487,562,572-byte downloads per NixOS/Ubuntu guest, independent unchanged SHA-256 pre/post references and at least one current-owner/generation attributed hit per original request window. No provider fault or multi-host claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [    def archive(self) -> None:](repo:scripts/egress_acceptance.py) — Baseline ef8e997f flake-4gib-regression: exact pinned nixpkgs tarball downloads on NixOS/Ubuntu and NixOS independent stores with locked revision/NAR hash and separate current attributed Nix cache-hit window. No local-store reuse counted as proxy evidence.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [    def large4gib(self) -> None:](repo:scripts/egress_acceptance.py) — Post-deployment b7e29b8f stable-post-4gib: NixOS new 7,487,562,572-byte publication then hit, Ubuntu two shared hits, exact independent pre/post SHA-256 references and current-owner/generation HTTPS 200 completions. Earlier interrupted stage remains failed; no in-flight restart-survival claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [    def archive(self) -> None:](repo:scripts/egress_acceptance.py) — Post-deployment b7e29b8f post-deploy-flake: exact pinned nixpkgs archives on NixOS/Ubuntu, two independent NixOS stores with locked revision/NAR hash and separate current-generation Nix cache-hit window.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-multi-gib-egress-cache.md)."
