msgid "- **manual, present**: [Retired evidence clone item 1](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-09-observability-decoupling.md) — Reviewed historical scope at the captured baseline; no current runtime acceptance claim..\n- **property, recorded**: [storage retry histories preserve authority and observations until success or failure](repo:lilly/test/vm/actor_test.exs) — Controlled executor retries and actor restart preserve durable outcomes and placement/epoch/generation. No physical launch claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-restart-recovery.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [published clones retain cleanup authority through failed restoration and replay](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_restoration_history_test.exs) — Real Ash/PostgreSQL rollback-sandbox histories with authenticated duplicate effect receipts and synthetic physical outcomes. Retains failed source restoration/retry, newer intent and complete cleanup predicates. Adds independent stable stopped competitor: queued acceptance, one/two/four activation refusals and immediate retries with exact complete six-resource inventories, activation after verified release and fresh reports, original first-release timestamps and competitor allocation preservation. No native, hosted, independent-process, distinct-endpoint or relocation-competitor claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-clone-competing-activation.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [competing relocation admission follows both endpoint stream receipts](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/relocation_competing_history_test.exs) — Recorded focused real action histories vary endpoint receipt order, wrong placement/epoch and one/two/four repeated refusals/replays. Repeated admission refusals and wrong receipts preserve exact inventories; one receipt retains slots, and both offered authenticated receipts permit stream-slot release. Coordinator advancement may fence the incumbent and enqueue its restoration stop. Actual competitor admission retains original slot IDs/timestamps while restoration and disk cleanup remain pending. Combined two-property run passed seed281508 in49.7seconds; Full batch precommit exited0: 1,418 checks (217 properties, 1,201 tests), two exclusions, seed981745,1055.5seconds; forced Dialyzer36.71seconds with zero errors, skips or unnecessary skips. Synthetic outcomes do not establish native stream cessation, process races or hosted faults.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-02-relocation-and-workflow-backlog-histories.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [native-restart-contention-before-launch](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/restart.exs) — Feature native restart-refusal subtests passed Ubuntu12.30s/NixOS18.60s: genuine pool contention and parent-accounting incoherence refuse without a launch, preserving intent, stoppedunit and boot/bundle files; malformed/missing bundle stays refused. This records the helper only, before pending complete lifecycles/newer-main integration.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-13-native-guest-coding-clis.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [defp stage_restart(execution, pool, source, generation, target) do](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/cloning.exs) — Quiet manually generated-driver Ubuntu customer clone subsection passed476.44s: genuine distinct-zpool source120/received121 with disjoint extents/Pool.distinct and real importjournal, three strict storage_busy unchanged boot/launch/Intent refusals, journal/GUID/nonce/bundle refusals, coherent neighbor restart, duplicatecopy/adopt, revoke/discard/prune, fencedsourcecleanup and GUID-verified zpooldestruction. Original clone data/divergence/delete assertions also passed. Neither complete packaged family nor cross-host/inference acceptance.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-13-native-guest-coding-clis.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [defp pending_import(pool, source, wire) do](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/cloning.exs) — Historical prepared-receive scope in the cited review: intent defers readiness before dataset birth while missing already-bound imports refuse. The extracted native customer-clone block passed in 854.79 seconds, including owned-staging and malformed journal/GUID/nonce/bundle cases, same-generation restart, independent writes, source deletion, surviving-copy read and final deletion. This records the captured historical source and subsection only; later distinct-source-zpool and packaged-family evidence is recorded separately.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-restart-recovery.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [defp pending_import(pool, source, wire) do](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/cloning.exs) — The genuine separate-source-zpool/cross-pool caller executed pre-native deferral and missing-bound refusal in the 476.44-second manually generated-driver Ubuntu focus. Later packaged NixOS and corrected complete Ubuntu clone/receive subtests passed in 464.60 and 392.45 seconds, including the final cleanup deadline guard, with full clone independence, restart/refusal and fenced cleanup oracles. NixOS's complete pass predates the post-import helper; its later current focused prefix omits the clone cases. The corrected complete Ubuntu pass exercised exact template reuse only; device-only replacement remains unexecuted. Both original Ubuntu failures and their unknown cause remain separate. Historical prepared-receive and focused Ubuntu evidence retain their source scopes; no cross-host or production activation acceptance.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-13-native-guest-coding-clis.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [true = Lilly.Host.ZFS.staging_identity?(identity)](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/cloning.exs) — Fixture-only incoherent parent accounting still fails strict inspection; exact stable native identity and private ownership defer restart without launch. Malformed ownership remains terminal.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-restart-recovery.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [def recover_published_clone() -> None:](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/porsche.py) — Fixture source launch failure after capture, published destination preservation, busy admission, public retry and physical cleanup before subsequent transfers.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-restart-recovery.md).\n- **property, present**: [clone histories cannot skip snapshots or publish after cancellation](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/state_machine_test.exs) — Generated clone state sequences..\n- **machine, recorded**: [clone audit survives source deletion with independent diagnostics](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/porsche.py) — Final typed focused NixOS Porsche fleet passed in869.30seconds on captured pre-Starship images/fixtures. After physical source/copy deletion, exact source/request/workflow/user enqueue and successful system completion audits for both public copies passed in0.49seconds, with zero provisioner diagnostics. No Ubuntu lifecycle or complete clone fault-matrix claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-09-observability-decoupling.md).\n- **manual, recorded**: [Acceptance failed: a pre-existing clone retained Overalls' transfer slot.](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-production-clone-relocation.md) — Production Porsche admission, failed clone receipts, exact replay, source guest access and read-only slot diagnosis; no independent copy was created.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-production-clone-relocation.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [queue histories retain identities while authority and retry eligibility change](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_history_test.exs) — Actual Ash action model of request identity, FIFO, authority, cancellation and retry eligibility.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [cancellation retains obligations through reordered evidence and revoked requester](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_history_test.exs) — Five independent recovery obligations across cancellable phases; synthetic evidence only.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [activation, new submission and queued retirement do not form a lock cycle](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_ordering_test.exs) — Three independent BEAMs and observed PostgreSQL waiters; both publication/cancel and activation/withdrawal orders also execute.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [unconfirmed capture retries the same effect until a bound receipt clears progress](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_history_test.exs) — Eight authenticated exchange histories with one through four unconfirmed capture receipts; same effect/intent and holds, no premature publication, exact success clearing and late replay stability. Synthetic host results only.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [revoked requester recovery reclaims only the unfinished copy and proven holds](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-cancellation/driver.py) — Captured 5af65d3f fourth native run passed public cancellation/withdrawal, snapshot and destination reclamation, exact holds/slots/addresses, original source identity/data, later stop and queued refusal. Automatic owner-clone control failed separately; two Lilly VMs share one physical test host.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [forward and cleanup uncertainty await the same bound effect without releasing holds](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_history_test.exs) — Authenticated exchange for all non-capture effect kinds and both revoke endpoints; retained effect/intent, phase, snapshot, exact commitments, success clearing and duplicate/late receipts. Synthetic host outcomes.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [cleanup preserves unrelated detached agent history sharing the requester](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_ordering_test.exs) — All thirteen agent table identities return to prior inventory after committed success and assertion/RPC-timeout failure schedules; a same-requester detached registration survives. Historical105-row agent residue is preserved and separately recorded.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [test_target_preserves_bytes_status_argv_and_single_execution](repo:nix/verification/tests/support/zfs_observation_recorder_test.py) — Disposable executable byte/status/signal and parent-death/lock custody, exact context, allowlist/bounds and fail-closed source seam checks, with pinned Python typing; no native ZFS or cancellation acceptance.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [Private bounded ZFS samples captured for ](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-cancellation/driver.py) — Tree fc22f9cd on 2d66: queued source_unavailable refusal before physical capture; six complete native read samples collected with missing readiness context, exact process drain and private extraction. No readiness-map/accounting replay, cancellation acceptance or timing claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [authenticated native observations supply admission capacity](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-cancellation/driver.py) — Tree 5dce161c on fff6587e: boot passed, initial admission timed out with invalid_report before source creation, recorder arming or activation. Three accepted reports survived in private offline DB evidence; exact rejected predicate remains unproven. All 18 owned identities drained.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [authenticated exchange preserves rollback, records exact guard age and recovers](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-cancellation/report_rejection_test.exs) — Seven dedicated fixture checks preserve original/instrumented exchange results, exact source AST after diagnostic erasure, predicate short circuit, transaction rollback and bounded private stage/age publication. Synthetic physical outcomes; no native host admission or cancellation acceptance.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-clone-cancellation-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [clone matrix classifications pin OSS/Customer retention, stopped-source power, grown-shape capture, image churn and post-publication ownership](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_matrix_test.exs) — Ash/PostgreSQL coordinator drives with synthetic physical receipts through the production clone state machine and authenticated effect exchange; no native disk claim. The stopped-source classification, OSS-profile coverage, image disable/rotation and inception configuration independence are new.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-matrix.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated profile and shape histories retain the captured source row through churn](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/clone_history_test.exs) — Generated profile/size/power/image-churn histories drive the real coordinator to completion and compare destination row and workload descriptor with the captured source row; disabled images refuse fresh admission while clones complete. Synthetic receipts only.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-clone-matrix.md).\n- **machine, present**: [clone-retained-shape-oracle](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/porsche.py) — Native row comparator on the real cross-host clone, ZFS origin emptiness and dataset GUID distinctness on both hosts, guest-console divergent-write invisibility on both copies, and post-publication public cancel refusal..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-oss-profile-native](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/porsche.py) — Native OSS source creation requests more than half the uniformly observed host core count and requires fresh measured headroom. The retained restart hold forces cross-host copy through the public path; catalog-disabled clone acceptance, retained OSS shape and fresh-admission refusal remain asserted. Corrected native execution pending..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-mid-copy-cancel-native](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/porsche.py) — Public Porsche request cancel issued while a real cross-host receive is in flight: source restoration with unchanged disk identity, destination dataset/row/hold reclaim and transfer-slot release before any later work..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-matrix-native-oracles](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-guest/clone-matrix.py) — Real clone after a completed 4 GiB resize with grown-disk physical capture, guest shape and marker checks, and a chained clone whose first received copy becomes the next source; native origin emptiness, GUID distinctness, divergent-write invisibility and deletion independence..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-destination-loss-mid-receive](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-permutations/destination-loss.py) — Destination provisioner crash after its receive-created dataset exists: cancellation retains destination hold, both slots and pending effects while the source restores, then real revoke/discard/prune finish after rejoin; cancelled request refuses retry..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-transfer-slot-arbitration](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-permutations/marshall-restart.py) — Two running sources on distinct hosts cloning concurrently: exactly one wins one-slot-per-host arbitration, the loser fails with a durable retryable admission refusal, and an explicit retry completes it with its own snapshot and destination..\n- **machine, present**: [clone-marshall-restart-mid-copy](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/clone-permutations/marshall-restart.py) — Restarting every Marshall replica after the physical receive began resumes the durable admitted request to exactly one complete, independent, marker-checked copy..\n- **property, present**: [generated clone and relocation claims retain exclusive host slots](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/relocation_ownership_test.exs) — Local Ash/PostgreSQL generated clone-versus-relocation claim on either endpoint with one to three retries; paired rollback, exclusive per-host occupancy, single owner role and release/reacquisition. No concurrent Marshall process or native stream observation."
