msgid "- **property, present**: [generated uncertain mail results retain identity and stop after commit](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_emails_test.exs) — One to three accepted-but-unobserved results leave the row pending; Message-ID and text/HTML digests stay fixed until successful delivery, and terminal replay sends nothing.\n- **property, recorded**: [generated implicit post-DATA timeout histories preserve retry identity](repo:marshall/test/marshall/mailer/smtp_test.exs) — Three generated real Swoosh/gen_smtp verified implicit-TLS histories: one/two complete-DATA uncertain attempts close by actual owner timeout; optional 451 refusal and successful retry preserve pending ciphertext, Message-ID and decoded token/text/HTML identity; one/two/three terminal replays open no connection. Local socket and SQL-sandbox scope; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-smtp-timeout-histories.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated starttls post-DATA timeout histories preserve retry identity](repo:marshall/test/marshall/mailer/smtp_test.exs) — Three generated real Swoosh/gen_smtp mandatory verified STARTTLS histories with unchanged ten-second owner deadline, complete DATA receipt, actual client closure, stable retry identity and terminal no-connection replay. Local socket and SQL-sandbox scope; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-smtp-timeout-histories.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated committed mail contention sends once and independently erases payload](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_distributed_property_test.exs) — Three independently started Marshall BEAMs and real PostgreSQL pools; actual outbox row-lock contention, third-peer committed pending read, one verified implicit-TLS SMTP submission, committed payload erasure and terminal replay; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-committed-worker-histories.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated mail owner crashes release committed row and preserve uncertain retry identity](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_distributed_property_test.exs) — Complete DATA then witnessed halt137 and SSL closure; blocked peer retries identical decoded identity and commits erased payload; third and newly started replacement peers independently read terminal state, and replacement replay opens no connection; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-committed-worker-histories.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated waiting mail workers refuse removed stored tokens after SMTP rejection](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_waiting_authority_property_test.exs) — Three independent Marshall BEAMs and PostgreSQL pools; witnessed outbox lock waiter, third-peer exact stored-token removal committed while outbox deadline remains future, transmitted 451 before owner deadline, terminal expired/nil and no second SMTP connection or terminal replay submission. Removal is not complete sign-in consumption.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-waiting-token-authority.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated waiting mail workers refuse expired stored tokens after SMTP rejection](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_waiting_authority_property_test.exs) — Three independent Marshall BEAMs and PostgreSQL pools; third peer commits stored-token expiry while waiter is blocked and outbox deadline remains future, transmitted 451 before owner deadline, terminal expired/nil and no second SMTP connection or replay submission. SQL backdating does not establish exact natural deadline timing.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-mail-waiting-token-authority.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated post-ack mail owner crashes preserve pending identity until retry commits](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_distributed_property_test.exs) — Actual SMTP250 then nonce-correlated open transaction/delivered/nil gate, independent committed pending ciphertext, exact row waiter, halt137, identical successor identity and replacement terminal replay. Historical three-property file passed70.4seconds; Current combined execution passed exit0,seed0,266.0s,19checks (9properties,10tests), including all four distributed properties; /tmp/overalls-mail-stable-identity-combined.log. Full typing/integration remain pending. Sender-derived-header mutant failed actual first/retry identity comparison (exit2,seed0,73.6s), with equal token/body digests; restored focused rotation passed1property,3excluded,seed0,28.1s. No later terminal observations after mutant failure are credited.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-05-auth-mail-post-ack-runtime.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated pending mail retries retain Message-ID across sender-domain rotation](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/auth_email_distributed_property_test.exs) — Actual verified-TLS SMTP and independent pools; successor sender domain changes after held post-ACK transaction, with independently verified configuration and complete first/retry identity comparison. Old source failed21.0seconds; first corrected selection passed22.9seconds before namespace-independent oracle refinement. Current combined execution passed exit0,seed0,266.0s,19checks (9properties,10tests), including all four distributed properties; /tmp/overalls-mail-stable-identity-combined.log. Full typing/integration remain pending. Sender-derived-header mutant failed actual first/retry identity comparison (exit2,seed0,73.6s), with equal token/body digests; restored focused rotation passed1property,3excluded,seed0,28.1s. No later terminal observations after mutant failure are credited.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-05-auth-mail-post-ack-runtime.md)."
