msgid "- **property, present**: [removing the owning entity attribute never preserves Cedar authority](repo:marshall/test/marshall/authorization/cedar_test.exs) — Generated VM, team and integration owner actions against the real Cedar evaluator; valid controls allow and resources missing their owner attribute refuse. This does not inject a database fault or prove an Ash authorizer caller boundary.\n- **unit, recorded**: [recently elevated ordinary users may read projections](repo:marshall/test/marshall/accounts/control_room_authority_test.exs) — Ordinary users cannot mutate through domain actions.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-control-room-read-access.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [current role and login histories govern Control room reads and audited writes](repo:marshall/test/marshall_web/control_room_history_test.exs) — Generated persisted role and session transitions; real browser/domain guards; target and audit invariants.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-control-room-verification.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [native-control-room-authority](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/control-room/browser.py) — One packaged serving replica, verified TLS, ordinary browsing, virtual WebAuthn and current stored authority.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-control-room-verification.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [native-control-room-authority](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/control-room/browser.py) — Current native nine-page admin inventory, ordinary reader access, virtual WebAuthn elevation, forged role-write refusal and unchanged audit/role state, revocation, demotion, mounted login expiry and export404. Real sign-out removes remembered custody before fresh-request refusal; one serving replica.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-09-observability-decoupling.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [native-subsequent-mfa-login](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/mfa-login/browser.py) — Three colocated serving replicas, virtual WebAuthn, subsequent magic-link and remembered login, actual backend and WebSocket observations, admin-UI mounted/copied-cookie revocation including a no-MFA account.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-25-mfa-login-verification.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [administrative revocation on one replica refuses every protected read on the others](repo:marshall/test/marshall_web/cross_replica_revocation_test.exs) — Three independent BEAM instances sharing committed PostgreSQL; mounted Control room, handbook and machine read checks, the mounted usage export and the account projection read action all refuse after revocation committed on another replica; commit-boundary race and partition fail-closed with rejoin enforcement. No independent-host claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-26-cross-replica-revocation.md)."
