ng a direct transaction-ID wait; exact committed endpoints, real activation, accounting and fixture restoration. Focused property passed seed219491 in51.6seconds, exit0. No native transfer, hosted search or order mutant evidence.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-03-distributed-host-lock-reach.md).\n- **property, recorded**: [generated multi-node races preserve committed capacity accounting](repo:marshall/test/marshall/compute/distributed_capacity_race_test.exs) — Generated operation histories over three independent Marshall BEAMs with synthetic-but-committed host telemetry.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-09-27-capacity-races.md).\n- **machine, present**: [capacity races spend pending startup headroom only once](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/fleet/scenarios/capacity.py) — Native fixed and generated fleet admission races under capacity pressure..\n- **unit, recorded**: [readiness observation reports identity refusal without raw paths or changed results](repo:lilly/test/host/zfs_logging_test.exs) — Frozen diagnostic-only missing-path regression proves unchanged incoherent refusal, fixed canonical_path/before metadata, private raw path/dataset and silence for ordinary or invalid-UUID calls. Focused 21 checks and full Lilly/Observability gates passed; no parent-accounting, healthy-backing, native storage or retry-success proof.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-10-browser-launcher.md).\n- **machine, recorded**: [for fault in [\"malformed\", \"timeout\", \"reload\"]](repo:nix/verification/tests/machines/zfs-io/driver.py) — Captured derivation hnv4wkrcrzxklbm7lywcgqnnpf1wyxd6: source-built Lilly and two real virtual ZFS pools; diagnostic I/O is separate from the control capacity report. No physical IOPS, production host, composed-driver type check or fleet admission claim.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-13-antithesis-prerequisites.md)."
