pt rejects an agent thread paired with a different root](repo:marshall/test/marshall/threads_transcript_test.exs) — The high-level transcript read refuses a cross-bound agent thread instead of returning its events.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-15-user-threads.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [failed provisioning exposes retry controls](repo:marshall/test/marshall_web/threads_live_test.exs) — The failed workspace exposes a provisioning error and retry control through stable DOM elements.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-15-user-threads.md).\n- **unit, recorded**: [missing thread displays an explicit not found state and refuses mutation events](repo:marshall/test/marshall_web/threads_live_test.exs) — A missing thread renders an explicit error and prompt, archive, delete, retry and reopen events remain refused without selected state.; [execution record](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-15-user-threads.md)."
