msgid "Boundary: A compiled pure protocol registry qualifies only complete reviewed FreeBSD and OmniOS manifests or portable descriptors. Marshall binds identity to its durable image row before allocation; Lilly repeats admission before launch. Promotion independently hashes actual artifacts and assembly plus all five native scenario evidence sets. Signed recursive-NAR substitution establishes publication custody separately from runtime readiness."
