msgid "Boundary: A recursive fixed-output Windows package binds exactly three dereferenced regular files, disk.raw, firmware and manifest.json, to reviewed NAR and manifest artifact pins with no store references. The shared fleet selector uses this package while the offline source installer remains independent. Existing signed-cache policy authenticates substitution; artifact identity grants no account access, execution capability, host isolation or storage mutation authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4313
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Boundary: A selected QEMU TCG NixOS Lilly host prepares a fixed ZFS member and samples pool/dataset GUIDs, capacity, and kernel cgroup CPU/memory. The private 9p witness identifies an image but does not grant Control authority. Enrollment and current authenticated reports must precede admission."
msgstr ""

