msgid "Required refusal: Missing or unadmitted selected images refuse preflight before creation; an explicit subset retains its scope. Changed fixture bindings refuse before new mutations or guest access. Transport failure, timeout, nonzero exit, a generic Linux response, a wrong distribution/native release or a catalog label alone cannot pass the OS oracle. Windows alone admits the exact stock three-line OpenSSH post-quantum warning with LF or CRLF endings; changed, extra or repeated stderr and the same warning from every other family fail, and no SSH trust or algorithm option changes. Unknown lifecycle outcomes retain the original request ID rather than creating fresh work; cleanup only uses the run's receipt-bound UUIDs."
