msgid "Required refusal: Source queries/fragments never enter capture storage/POST; URL user information refuses there, and raw authority/path stays strict backend input. Malformed or expired capture, missing CSRF, revoked or MFA-pending identity creates no machine. Unsupported origins/routes, option-shaped values, non-egress profiles, absent/obsolete/mismatched source capability and changed source under one idempotency key refuse before allocation. A stale completion cannot clear a newer observed capture. Stale boots, source conflicts, foreign API clone origins, redirects and obsolete stored sources refuse; a done marker cannot bypass stored-source validation. Supplied snapshots cannot replace the retained immutable image or recorded source. Unavailable restart capability releases only confirmed stopped compute and retains disk/address; confirmed resize completes a fixed source-unavailable failure, preserving target sizes and ordinary cleanup."
