#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7931
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Required refusal: The build fails without the OVERALLS-SETUP-COMPLETE serial marker and the firmware build fails without the PVH note or the patched aperture. The guest has a bootstrap Administrator credential and an interactive SAC login on serial, which must not be mistaken for the Linux console boundary. The manifest carries exactly the eight version-5 keys; a display name or any version-4 field is refused by the protocol."
