msgid "Required refusal: Unknown children, foreign or corrupt claims/owners/GUIDs, unsafe mounts/drives/boot-file custody, damaged disk metadata, exceeded artifact bounds and unexpected files continue to withhold the pool. An invalid launch bundle cannot grant allocation credit, readiness, execution, image admission, metadata conversion or deletion authority. Recognition of retained storage cannot authorize guest access or physical cleanup."
