#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7983
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Required refusal: Viewers and revoked actors cannot answer or implement. Child agents cannot ask human questions. Stale, cancelled, archived or nonactive requests refuse. Competing answers cannot overwrite a winner, changed replay inputs conflict and partial proposal output cannot be implemented. Mode changes while work runs or awaits answers refuse."
