#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10926
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "[ADR-0197](repo:docs/architecture/decisions/0197-localized-human-surfaces.md) accepts a saved account language override with session/browser negotiation and English fallback. The supported catalog list includes Japanese, Hindi, Filipino, Estonian, Finnish, Swedish and Brazilian/European Portuguese. Arabic and Urdu use right-to-left document direction; other supported locales are left-to-right. Human browser, email, documentation and interactive Porsche prose are localization targets. Machine JSON, protocol identifiers, diagnostic events and terminal bytes remain unchanged. Implementation and recorded browser/native evidence remain partial."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:11062
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "`services.marshall.editorPackages` and `services.audi.editorPackages` map the\nfinite targets `linux-x64` and `win32-x64` to approved source-built packages.\nBoth default to `{ linux-x64 = packages.vscodeWeb; }`; an empty attribute set\ndisables that role's editor capability. Windows requires an explicitly selected,\nreviewed native bundle and does not enter the default catalog."
msgstr ""
